OL,3,GNEWSAMajor concerts to return to Platt
OL,4,AFields Park
OL,5,
OL,6,FLarge outdoor concerts are due to
OL,7,Freturn to Manchester's Platt Fields
OL,8,FPark next summer, with LCD Soundsystem
OL,9,Fnamed as the first headliner.
OL,11,FThe American rock band will perform at
OL,12,Fthe park in Fallowfield on 30 July
OL,13,F2027, with Young Fathers, Cowboy
OL,14,FHunters and DJs Erol Alkan and Luka Una
OL,15,Falso on the bill.
OL,17,FOrganisers said the concert would be
OL,18,Fpart of a series of shows, each with a
OL,19,Fcapacity of 25,000, taking place over
OL,20,Ftwo weekends in late July and early
OL,21,FAugust.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
