OL,3,GNEWSAMajor concerts to return to Platt
OL,4,AFields Park
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe events, called PlattForm, are being
OL,7,Forganised by The Warehouse Project, SJM
OL,8,FConcerts and Live Nation, with more
OL,9,Fartists due to be announced in the
OL,10,Fcoming weeks.
